Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:57.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:03.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你误会了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l think you misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才，嗯…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What l was, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:08.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- …是说…  - 我明白\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- …saying…  - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:13.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我换个座位好了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l think I'm going to find another seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:16.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我无意，嗯…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l…I didn't mean, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:56.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是他没有意识到的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's what he fail to realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我看起来很优雅，不是垃圾\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I look classy, not trashy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我看起来也很优雅\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I look classy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:02.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那我呢，我不优雅吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What about me? Don't l look classy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:06.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,但恐怕你忘了…这个！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}But I'm afraid you forgot…this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:07.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这个！还有…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And this! And…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:10.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你到哪里去了，香蕉？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Where has you been, Banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:12.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓到你了，黄鼠狼\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Now I've got you, Weasel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:14.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,有些车厢仍在燃烧…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Some cars Are still on fire…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:17.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…残骸到处都是\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and the debris is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:19.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在还无法确定…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We are not sure at this time…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:21.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…救援人员将如何到达现场\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…how rescue personnel will be able to get on scene at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:23.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,您若是刚转到这个频道…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}If you're just tuning in…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:25.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…东铁177列车…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…East rail train number 177…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…刚刚在费城郊外脱轨\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…has derailed just outside Philadelphia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:29.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将为您带来天空4台的现场报道\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And We're bringing you live coverage from Skycam 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:32.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，那似乎是一辆救援救护车…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yes, that appears to be a rescue ambulance…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:33.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…后面还有更多\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and there are more behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:35.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以看到路上还有更多\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l can see on the access road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:38.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道他们该如何靠近现场，大卫\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l don't know how close they're gonna be able to get, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:40.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这里都是木头，嗯，树\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}These are woods and, uh, trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:43.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这次救援将会异常艰巨吧？救援工作…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Uh, it's gonna be a very difficult? Rescue effort…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.85,0:09:50.80,标题 - 副（方正粗黑 25）,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fscx390\fscy340\alpha&H99\c&H1C64E6&\bord0\shad0\pos(312,272)}■
