Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.85,0:09:50.80,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fn千图笔锋手写体\fs20\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\pos(297,200)}东铁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.85,0:09:50.80,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fn千图笔锋手写体\fs20\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\pos(306,221)}177次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.85,0:09:50.80,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fn千图笔锋手写体\fs20\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\pos(315,240)}下午3:40
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:01.14,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,去掉一些吧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hack some of that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:17.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，我是杜宾医生\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hi. I'm Dr Dubin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:20.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在在费城市市立医院的急诊室\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You're in the emergency room in the Philadelphia City Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:23.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚遭遇一场严重意外\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You were in a serious accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:25.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你感觉如何？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:31.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:35.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要问你几个问题\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm going to ask you some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:38.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你过去有过心脏或者哮喘问题吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Have you ever had any heart or asthma problems in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:40.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:43.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,肾脏或者与肾脏相关的问题？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Kidney or renal problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:45.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:46.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,过敏反应呢？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Any allergies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.60,0:10:49.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:58.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,在火车上，你坐在什么位置？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Where were you sitting on the train?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:04.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 靠窗的位置  - 在客车车厢？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- Against the window.  - In the passenger car?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:12.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,其他乘客在哪里？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Where are the other passengers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:15.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你的家人和你同行吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Was your family travelling with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:18.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.20,0:11:22.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你有离开座位吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Did you get up from your seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:31.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定，你当时在客车车厢里吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Are you certain you were in the passenger car?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:47.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么那样看着我？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.30,0:11:50.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你坐的火车出轨了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Your train derailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,因为某种故障\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Some kind of maIfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:56.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,目前为止，只发现两人生还\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They only found 2 people alive so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:59.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你和这个人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You and this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:02.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他的颅骨破裂…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}His skull Was cracked open…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:04.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…左侧身体的大部分被压碎\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and most of his left side Was crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:07.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,回答你之前的问题…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And to answer your question…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.80,0:12:10.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我这样看你有两个理由\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…there are 2 reasons why l'm looking at you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:14.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一、因为似乎再过几分钟…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}One, because it seems in a few minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:17.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…你将成为，这次火车事故的唯一生还者\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…that you will officially be the only survivor of this train wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:20.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,二…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And two…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:24.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…因为你几乎毫发无损\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…because you didn't break one bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你身上连擦伤都没有\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You don't have a scratch on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:14.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}David?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:21.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约…怎么样了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What happened…in New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:26.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我没得到那份工作\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l don't think l got the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:29.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是要去，嗯…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm still going, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:33.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是会搬去那里\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm still moving there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:35.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，只是不是现在\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Oh, just not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.10,0:14:45.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:50.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Good night.
