Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:05.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉·阿里斯顿…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Sara Elaston…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:09.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…布罗德和槐树社区中心的社会工作者\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…social worker at Broad and Locust Community Centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:12.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为你的灵魂祈祷\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We pray for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:19.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,凯文·埃利奥特，商人，六个孩子的父亲\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Kevin Elliot, businessman, father of 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:22.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为你的灵魂祈祷\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We pray for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:25.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,格伦·史蒂文斯…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Glen Stevens…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:29.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…白血病的研究学者…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…researcher in the area of leukemia…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:32.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…任教于德雷塞尔大学\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…at Drexel University.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:35.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为你的灵魂祈祷\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We pray for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.30,0:15:39.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,詹妮弗·彭尼曼…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Jennifer Pennyman…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:44.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…杰佛逊小学三年级老师\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…third grade teacher at Jefferson Elementary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:48.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为你的灵魂祈祷\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We pray for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:18.68,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn千图笔锋手写体\fs14\bord0\shad0\c&H2F2F2F&\pos(256.8,102.734)}你一生之中生过几天病?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:56.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:58.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,诺埃尔在吗，女士？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Is Noel in, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:00.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没有，先生，他不在\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No, sir, he is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:04.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我在报纸上看到你的新闻\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l read about you in the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:07.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我也遇到过一次事故\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l was in an accident once, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:10.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我差点被一匹马踩死\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}A horse almost trampled me to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,它安乐死了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Had him put down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:17.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一个悲伤的故事\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's a sad story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:25.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你能帮我问诺埃尔一件事情吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Could you ask Noel something for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:27.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:29.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你能让他查一下，在这里工作以来…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Would you ask him to check how many sick days…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:31.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我请了多少天病假吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…I've taken since I've worked here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:35.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就问这些？ - 是的，女士\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- That the entire message?  - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:40.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:20.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，诺埃尔\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hey, Noel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:23.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么，你脑袋被火车撞到了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What, you hit your head on that train?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:26.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,让你的大脑重新开始工作了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Get your brain to start working again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:28.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:30.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,40块\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}40 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:34.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么40块？ - 你每周加薪40块\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- 40$ what?  - You're getting a 40$ a week raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:35.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我查过了，你是对的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l checked. You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:40.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你从来没有请过病假\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You've never taken a sick day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.40,0:18:44.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,五年，全勤，我明白，你想加薪\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}5 years, no sick day. l get it. You want a raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:46.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你表达的方式很聪明\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Smart way to make your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约瑟夫还好吧？ - 是的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- Is Joseph okay?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:17.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他睡了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:24.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想问你一个问题\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l wanted to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:27.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这听起来有点奇怪，但是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}it's gonna sound a little strange,but…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:30.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…嗯，只是要你想一想，好吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…uh, just think about it for a second, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:32.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我上一次生病是什么时候？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}When's the last time l was sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.80,0:19:37.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:43.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，我不知道\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Um, l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:47.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,有一段时间了吧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:51.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我今年还没生过病，这我知道\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l haven't been sick this year, l know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:53.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:56.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得我生过病吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Do you remember me getting sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:04.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不太确定\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Not a specific day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:07.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:12.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,奥黛丽，你还记得我生过病吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Audrey, do you remember me ever getting sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:15.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,在我们住这里的三年时光里？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}In the 3 years we lived in this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:17.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,在老公寓的时候？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}In the old apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:21.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,在约瑟夫出生之前？在我们结婚之前？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Before Joseph was born? Before we ever got married?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:26.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不记得了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:31.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得这有点奇怪吗…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Don't you think that's kind of weird…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.20,0:20:36.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…不记得感冒、发烧或者喉咙痛吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…not remembering one cold or a fever or a sore throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:39.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为这意味着什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What do you think it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:51.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想这意味着可能太累了，想不起来了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l think it means probably too tired to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:10.64,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(560,520)\fn方正正粗黑_GBK\fs17\fsp2\fscx90\fscy120\bord1\shad1\b1\pos(193,184)}费城西区
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:34.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再呆坐房间里\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No more sitting in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:36.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样呆着已经够久了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l let it go on long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:38.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会再出去了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm not going out there any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:40.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再受伤了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm not getting hurt again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:42.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉过你，这是最后一次\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}This was the last time, l told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:44.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你对此无能为力\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You can't do anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:47.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你随时可能跌倒在椅子和电视之间\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You might fall between this chair and that television.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:49.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这就是上帝的旨意…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}If that's what God has planned for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:50.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…那这一切必将发生\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…that's what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.40,0:21:53.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你即使躲在房间里，也无法逃避\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You can't hide from it sitting in a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.80,0:21:58.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,同学们都叫我玻璃娃娃…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They call me Mr Glass at school…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:22:00.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…因为我跟玻璃一样易碎\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…because l break like glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:08.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在因为恐惧…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You make this decision now…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:11.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而做出的决定…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…to be afraid…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:15.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…将使你永远无法摆脱恐惧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and you will never turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.70,0:22:21.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一生当中，恐惧将一直伴随着你\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Your whole life, you will always be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.30,0:22:39.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我有个礼物要送你  - 为什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- l got a present for you.  - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:42.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,别管为什么\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Forget why.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:47.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你想不想要？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You want it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.10,0:22:51.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，去拿吧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Well, go get it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:54.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,它在哪里\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.40,0:22:57.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,在街对面的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}On a bench…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:00.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…长椅上\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:16.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,会被别人拿走的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Someone's going to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.20,0:23:20.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你最好尽快去拿\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Then you better get out there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.40,0:24:37.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我买了一整套\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l bought a whole bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.90,0:24:44.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,每次只要你想来这里…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}There'll be one of these waiting for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.00,0:24:46.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…都会有一本在这里等你\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…every time you want to come out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.00,0:24:56.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说这一部有一个惊喜的结局\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They say this one has a surprise ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:07.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是弗里茨·坎皮恩的私人珍藏\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}This is from Fritz Campion's own library.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.10,0:25:09.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他在1968年…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}This is before the first…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.50,0:25:12.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…第一期漫画问世之前的作品\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…issue of the comic book hit the stands in 1968.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.10,0:25:16.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是对善与恶的经典描绘\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}it's a classic depiction of good vs. evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.30,0:25:19.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,注意鬼剑士的方形下巴…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Notice the square jaw of Slayer…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.30,0:25:21.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…这在大多数漫画英雄中很常见\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…common in most comic heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.40,0:25:23.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,还有杰克罗头部与身体的的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And the slightly disproportionate size…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.10,0:25:25.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…尺寸有点不成比例\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…of Jaguaro's head to his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.30,0:25:29.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这种情况很常见，但只有坏蛋是这样的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}This again is common, but only in villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.50,0:25:31.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这件作品值得注意的是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The thing to notice about this piece…\NMmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.90,0:25:35.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…它对人物的逼真描绘，使它…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…the thing that makes it very, very special…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:38.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…变得非常、非常特别\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…is its realistic depiction of its figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.10,0:25:41.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,当那些人物登上杂志时…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}When the characters reached the magazine…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.50,0:25:43.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…他们被夸大了…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…they were exaggerated…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.50,0:25:45.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…事情一向如此\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…a so ways happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:49.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是幅杰作\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}This is vintage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.50,0:26:01.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，包起来\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Well…wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.00,0:26:05.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你做出了一个相当明智的决定\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You've made a considerably wise decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:12.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我的孩子会高兴的发狂\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Well, my kid's gonna go berserk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.50,0:26:17.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,请再说一遍？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Once again, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.60,0:26:20.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子杰布，这是送给他的礼物\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}My son Jeb it's a gift for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.50,0:26:22.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,杰布多大了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How old is Jeb?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.70,0:26:24.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,四岁\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He's 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.30,0:26:27.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.50,0:26:32.68,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:36.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在可以走了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You need to go. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.00,0:26:40.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我说什么了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What'd l say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.20,0:26:42.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你在我这里看到天线宝宝了吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Do you see any teletubbies in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.60,0:26:45.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到我衬衫上夹着一个…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Do you see a slender plastic tag…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.40,0:26:47.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…塑料标签，上面印着我的名字吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…clipped to my shirt with my name printed on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.90,0:26:49.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有看到一个亚洲小孩…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Did you see a little asian child…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.70,0:26:51.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…表情茫然的，坐在外面的一架…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…with a blank expression sitting outside…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.10,0:26:52.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…当你把25美分放进去时…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…in a mechanical helicopter…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.60,0:26:54.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…就开始转动的直升机吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…that shakes when you put quarters in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.90,0:26:56.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没有吧？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.40,0:26:58.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，那是玩具店才能看到的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Well, that's what you see at a toy store…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.70,0:27:00.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…你一定以为自己在玩具店…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and you must think you're in a toy store…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.50,0:27:03.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…因为你要买东西，送给你的小鬼杰布\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…because you're here shopping for an infant named Jeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.30,0:27:07.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,现在，我们中的有人犯了严重的错误…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Now, one of us has made a gross error…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.20,0:27:10.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…浪费了另一个人宝贵的时间\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and wasted the other person's valuable time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.70,0:27:12.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是艺术馆，我的朋友…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}This is an art gallery, my friend,…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.90,0:27:16.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而这个…是一件艺术品\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and this…is a piece of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.00,0:27:34.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只接待预约顾客\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We're by appointment only.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.80,0:27:37.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我收到贵店的卡片\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l got a card from this store.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.50,0:27:39.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜，你有一个信箱\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Congratulations, you have a mailbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.50,0:27:42.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,展览已经过期两周了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The exhibition isn't for 2 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.10,0:27:45.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这张是夹在我车子雨刮器下面的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}This one was under the windshield wiper of my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:51.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你有多少把握自己从未生过病？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How certain are you that you've never taken ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.00,0:27:53.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,75%\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}75%
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.40,0:27:57.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，这还不算很确定，对吧？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Well… that's not certain at all, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.60,0:28:00.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那是第一个问题\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's hole number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.60,0:28:04.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我对这一切持有严格的怀疑态度\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l'm going to be extremely skeptical about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.80,0:28:06.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,关于什么的？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}About all What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.30,0:28:10.58,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你从来没有受过伤\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm assuming you've never been injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.58,0:28:11.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我这样假设没错吧？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Would l be wrong in that assumption?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.60,0:28:13.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸受过伤\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Dad's been injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.90,0:28:17.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这孩子说得对吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Is the child correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.10,0:28:19.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.90,0:28:22.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我念大学的时候，出过车祸\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}In college, l was in a car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.20,0:28:23.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,很严重吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Was It serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.70,0:28:26.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他再也不能再踢足球了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He couldn't play football any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.20,0:28:29.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那是第二个问题\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's hole number2.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.00,0:28:32.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,很大的问题\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.60,0:28:38.26,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,普莱斯先生，我们能谈谈留在…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Mr Price, can we talk about the note…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.26,0:28:40.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我车上的那张纸条吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…that you left on my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.60,0:28:43.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我仔细的研究过漫画\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I've studied the form of comics intimately.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.00,0:28:46.27,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我三分之一的人生，都躺在病床上…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I've spent a third of my life in a hospital bed…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.62,0:28:48.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…除了读书，我别无选择\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…with nothing else to do but read.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.30,0:28:52.49,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信漫画是我们与…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l believe comics are our last link…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.62,0:28:54.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…古老的历史进行传承的最后一环\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…to an ancient way of passing on history.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.20,0:28:57.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,埃及人在墙壁上作画\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The Egyptians drew on the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.40,0:28:59.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界各国仍然通过…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Countries all over the world…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.70,0:29:01.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…图画的形式传承知识\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…still pass on knowledge through pictorial forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.80,0:29:04.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信漫画是某个地方的某个人…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l believe comics are a form of history…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.10,0:29:07.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…所感受或经历的一种历史形式\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…that someone somewhere felt or experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.70,0:29:09.05,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,然后，这些经历和历史，理所当然的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Then, of course, those experiences and that history…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.05,0:29:11.11,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…经过商业机器的吞噬、转化…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…got chewed up in the commercial machine…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.21,0:29:13.51,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…变成生动有趣、令人兴奋…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…got jazzed up, made titillating…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.64,0:29:16.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…的卡通，上架销售\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…cartooned for the sale rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.50,0:29:20.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这座城市经历过许多灾难\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}This city has seen its share of disasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.00,0:29:23.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我目睹过飞机失事的场景\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l watched the aftermath of that plane crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.50,0:29:26.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我目睹过酒店大火的惨剧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l watched the carnage of the hotel fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.20,0:29:28.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我看着新闻，希望听到…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l watched the news waiting to hear…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.20,0:29:31.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…一个非常特别的的单词组合…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…a very specific combination of words…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:33.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…但我从未听到过\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…but they never came.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.80,0:29:37.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,然后有一天，我看到一则火车事故的新闻…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Then one day l saw a news story about a train accident…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.60,0:29:39.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我终于听到了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and l heard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.70,0:29:41.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,事故中只有一位幸存者…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}There is a sole survivor…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.90,0:29:45.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而他奇迹般的毫发无伤\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and he is miraculously unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:51.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我患有一种叫做{\u1}成骨不全症{\u0}的疾病\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l have something called {\u1}Osteogenesis Imperfecta{\u0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:51.60,标题 - 副（方正粗黑 25）,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fscx680\fscy300\alpha&H80\c&H403026&\bord0\shad0\pos(317.4,263)}■
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:51.60,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs12\b1\pos(316,182)}成骨不全症{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs10}（Osteogenesis Imperfecta）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:51.60,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\pos(315.8,196)}又称脆骨病或脆骨-蓝巩膜-耳聋综合征，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:51.60,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(315,209)}是一种少见的先天性骨骼发育障碍性疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:51.60,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(315,222)}由间充质组织发育不全，胶原形成障碍而
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:51.60,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(276,235)}引起的疾病。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.60,0:29:53.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一种遗传疾病\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}lt's a genetic disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.80,0:29:56.15,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我无法正常的制造某种蛋白质…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l don't make a particular protein very well…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.19,0:29:58.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…所以使我的骨骼密度很低\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and it makes my bones very low in density.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.60,0:30:00.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,非常容易骨折\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Very easy to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.80,0:30:03.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我这辈子骨折过54次…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I've had 54 breaks in my life…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.40,0:30:06.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而我的情况，是这种疾病中最轻微的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and l have the tamest version of this disorder…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.50,0:30:08.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…第一型…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…type one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.30,0:30:11.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,还有第二、第三、第四型\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}There are type2, type3, type 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.10,0:30:14.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,第四型甚至都活不久\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Type 4 don't last very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.70,0:30:18.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才会突然有这个想法\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}So that's how it popped into my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.20,0:30:21.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果世界上，存在着我这样的人…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}If there is someone like me in the world…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.71,0:30:24.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而我属于这个群体的一端…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and I'm at one end of the spectrum…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.00,0:30:26.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…那么，在另一端会不会有…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…couldn't there be someone else…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.20,0:30:28.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…和我相反的人存在着呢？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…the opposite of me at the other end?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.60,0:30:30.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不会生病的人…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Someone who doesn't get sick…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:32.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…一个不会像我们一样受伤的人？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…who doesn't get hurt like the rest of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.10,0:30:36.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,而他也许根本不自知\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And he probably doesn't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.00,0:30:41.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这些故事里所描绘的那种人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The kind of person these stories are about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.20,0:30:46.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一个现实之中，能够保护我们的人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}A person put here to protect the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.40,0:30:49.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,护卫我们\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}To guard us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.90,0:30:53.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为我爸爸是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You think my dad's a real…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.30,0:30:56.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在什么都没想\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l don't think anything right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.50,0:30:58.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个存在…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}lt's apossibility…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.10,0:31:01.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…很多漏洞的可能\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…one with many holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.60,0:31:07.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,约瑟夫，别再喝那杯水l了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Joseph, don't take another sip of that water.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.50,0:31:12.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,去把它扔掉\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Go throw it in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.30,0:31:14.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可是，爸爸…  - 快去\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- But, Dad…  - Do it now, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.20,0:31:27.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我在工作中，经常遇到像你这样的人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l see guys like you all the time in my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.00,0:31:31.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你们找到了一个想利用的人…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You find someone you want to take advantage of…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.60,0:31:34.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…给他们讲了一个奇妙的故事…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…you tell them a fantastic story…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.10,0:31:37.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而你们真正想表达的是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and somewhere in there you say it…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.10,0:31:40.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我只需要你的信用卡号码…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…l just need your credit card number…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.10,0:31:43.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…来支付一小笔预付款\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…a small down payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.80,0:31:47.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,今天早晨是我记得的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}This morning was the first morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.20,0:31:48.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…第一个早晨…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…that l could remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.20,0:31:50.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我没有睁开眼睛，就感觉到…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…that l didn't open my eyes and feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.70,0:31:54.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…悲伤\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.40,0:32:00.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为写那张纸条的人…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l thought the person that wrote that note…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:01.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…可以给我一个答案\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…had an answer for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.50,0:32:10.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l'm gonna leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.80,0:32:13.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你的展览顺利\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Good luck with your exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.80,0:32:16.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你是做什么工作的，大卫？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}So, what kind of job do you have, David?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.30,0:32:18.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你说在工作中，遇到过像我这样的人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You said you've met guys like me in your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.50,0:32:20.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是做什么的？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What exactly is it that you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.50,0:32:22.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我在大学体育场工作\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l work at the University Stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.10,0:32:25.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一名警卫\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm a security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.40,0:32:33.50,标题 - 副（方正粗黑 25）,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fscx840\fscy80\alpha&H55\c&H6C6768&\bord0\shad0\frz3.05\move(196,249,196,176,0,1500)}■
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.40,0:32:33.50,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\frz2.977\fs18\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\move(196,236,196,162,0,1500)}火车事故唯一生还者是本地人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.22,0:33:51.02,标题 - 副（方正粗黑 25）,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fscx460\fscy80\alpha&H55\c&H5D7376&\bord0\shad0\frz10.16\move(211,235,177,111)}■
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.22,0:33:51.02,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\frz10.28\move(210,220,175,97)}勇士队迈向冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.87,0:34:09.52,标题 - 副（方正粗黑 25）,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fscx900\fscy80\alpha&H55\c&H5D7376&\bord0\shad0\frz8.417\pos(210.4,219.866)}■
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.87,0:34:09.52,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\pos(209.2,206.133)\frz8.176}本地足球明星在重大车祸中受伤\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.70,0:34:16.68,标题 - 副（方正粗黑 25）,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fscx840\fscy80\alpha&H55\c&H5D7376&\bord0\shad0\frz349.1\pos(155,220)}■
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.70,0:34:16.68,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\pos(158,207)\frz349.4}火车事故唯一生还者是本地人\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.40,0:34:42.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.70,0:34:46.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了一个决定\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I've come to a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.80,0:34:48.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Okey
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.10,0:34:51.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想问你一件事，可以吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l just want to ask you something, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.90,0:34:54.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要诚实回答\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And you can be totally honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.40,0:34:57.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我已准备面对任何答案…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm prepared for any answer…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.30,0:34:59.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而不会受它影响\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and it won't affect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.50,0:35:04.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你和别人交往过吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Have you been with anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.40,0:35:06.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是，从我们出现问题以后\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l mean, since we've been having problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.80,0:35:09.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你的答案不会影响我的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The answer won't affect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.00,0:35:14.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是需要知道，明白吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l just need to know, you know?
