Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.20,0:35:20.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.90,0:35:31.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉，大卫，抱歉\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Sorry, David. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.50,0:35:38.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,总之…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.90,0:35:41.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我的决定是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black\s1}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…my decision is…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.10,0:35:46.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我想重新开始\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…that l want to start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.80,0:35:53.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望一切都能重新开始\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That l want it to be like it was in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.90,0:36:00.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你从火车事故中生还，这意义重大\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And it's a big deal that you walked away from that train.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.30,0:36:04.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得这是第二次机会\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l feel like it's a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:13.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想找个时间，约我出去…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And if you feel like asking me out sometime…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.80,0:36:15.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…没问题\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…it'd be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.20,0:36:19.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.80,0:36:35.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,- 邓恩  - 我是邓恩\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- Dunn.  - Go for Dunn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:36.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我是詹金斯\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It's Jenkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.60,0:36:39.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，我们在17C入口，抓到一个持假票的家伙\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Look, We got a guy over at gate 17C with a bogus ticket.
