Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.00,0:36:45.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他长什么样子？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What's he look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.80,0:36:47.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得，为什么…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Why is it, do you think…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.90,0:36:49.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…在世界上所有的职业中…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…that of all the professions in the world…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.40,0:36:51.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…你要选择做警卫？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…you chose protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.20,0:36:55.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个很奇怪的人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You are a very strange man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.00,0:36:56.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你原本可以成为一名会计师\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You could have been a tax accountant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.30,0:36:57.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你原本可以拥有自己的健身房\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You could have owned your own gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.60,0:36:59.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你原本可以开一家连锁餐厅\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You could've opened a chain of restaurants.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.30,0:37:01.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你原本可以去做万里挑一的事情…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You could've done one of 1 0,000 things…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.60,0:37:05.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…但最后，你选择了保护人们\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…but in the end, you chose to protect people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.80,0:37:07.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你做出的那个决定…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You made that decision…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.60,0:37:10.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…让我觉得非常非常有趣\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and l find that very, very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.60,0:37:14.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我要你的信用卡号码\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Now all l need is your credit card number.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.70,0:37:17.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一句是开玩笑\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That last part was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.50,0:37:23.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个体育迷，是吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You're a big sports fan, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.00,0:37:26.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,它开始引起我的兴趣了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}it's starting to intrigue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.60,0:37:30.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛开始前10分钟，是最拥挤的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It gets heaviest 10 minutes before kick off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.10,0:37:44.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,请遵守秩序，保持秩序\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Program here. Program.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.90,0:37:46.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,保持秩序\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Program.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.60,0:37:49.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,保持秩序\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Program.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.50,0:37:54.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,- 里奇，为什么不搜身？ - 好的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- Rich, why don't we pat down?  - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.50,0:37:56.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给我一分钟  - 有问题吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- Just give me a minute.  - ls there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.60,0:37:58.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,抱歉，我得对你进行检查\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm sorry, I'm gonna have to search you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.60,0:38:02.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那个穿着迷彩外套的高个子\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The tall guy in the camouflage jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.00,0:38:04.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,有时人们携带武器来到这里…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Sometimes people carry weapons in here…
