Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.00,0:38:14.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…以阻止他们携带武器\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…to discourage people from carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.40,0:38:18.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他有携带，他会离开队伍\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}If he's carrying, he'll step out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.00,0:38:33.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,好了，快跟上\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yeah, step right up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.10,0:38:44.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.10,0:38:47.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你安排了一个黄区的座位\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l got you a seat up in the yellow section.
