Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.40,0:38:51.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…但至少你不会被人吐口水\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…but at least you won't get spit on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.00,0:38:54.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.00,0:38:55.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道，你碰到的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How'd you know that guy you bumped…
