Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.50,0:39:01.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.70,0:39:03.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是因为…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Maybe it was that…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.10,0:39:05.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…他穿的那件迷彩外套吧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…camouflage army jacket he was wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.30,0:39:09.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那些家伙，喜欢带着猎刀之类的东西\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Those guys like to carry hunting knives and stuff for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.20,0:39:11.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为他身上带着刀？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You thought he was carrying a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.60,0:39:14.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为他带了什么东西，是的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l thought he was carrying something, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.40,0:39:16.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是一把刀\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}But not a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.30,0:39:20.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l got a…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.30,0:39:24.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…他裤子里藏着把黑柄银色…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…picture of a silver gun with a black grip…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.40,0:39:26.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…手枪的画面\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…tucked in his pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.70,0:39:29.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道，就像电视上一样\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You know, like on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.50,0:39:33.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你对那种事情的直觉很准吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You have good instincts for things like that?
