Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.80,0:39:37.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,知道人们在什么时候，做错了什么\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Knowing when people have done something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.37,0:39:41.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.70,0:39:43.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你有试过开发这种能力吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Have you ever tried to develop it?
