Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.00,0:40:05.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再玩这种游戏了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l don't want to play this game any more.
