Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.80,0:40:10.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,也许只是基于本能…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Maybe it's based on something…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.50,0:40:12.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…一样简单的东西\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…as simple as instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.10,0:40:15.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,但他有可能什么都没带\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}But he might not have been carrying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.90,0:40:17.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能在他裤子里，正藏着把…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}But he might have been carrying a silver gun…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.70,0:40:19.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…黑柄银色的手枪\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…with a black grip tucked in his pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.70,0:40:21.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,邓恩\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Dunn.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.70,0:40:23.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.00,0:40:27.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，知道了，我马上就下来\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yeah, l know. I'll be right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.30,0:40:28.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一个问题\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}One last question.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.10,0:40:30.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.70,0:40:32.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你遭遇的那场车祸\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That car accident you were in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.10,0:40:35.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,当时还有别人在吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Was there anyone else involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.30,0:40:38.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.10,0:40:40.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,我的妻子奥黛丽\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}My wife Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.70,0:40:43.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,她跟我一起在车里\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}She was in the car with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.90,0:40:47.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你生活愉快，以利亚\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Have a good life, Elijah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.90,0:40:49.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,下次，请记得在授权的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Next time, try to buy your tickets…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.50,0:40:51.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…销售点购买门票\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…at an authorized sales location.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.40,0:40:55.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上到\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.20,0:41:01.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…对177次列车事故的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…into the investigation of train 177…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.90,0:41:05.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…调查工作在东铁库房展开\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…being conducted at the east rail holding warehouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:07.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,市议会计划通过一项紧急法案…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The city council has stepped up plans to pass a bill…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.70,0:41:11.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…要求对费城及其外围地区的所有…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…requiring higher standards for inspection and maintenance…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.00,0:41:13.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…铁路运输执行更高的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…of all rail transportation in Philadelphia…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.90,0:41:15.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…检查和维护标准\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and its outlying districts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.60,0:41:25.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等!\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hold up a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.30,0:42:23.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想问你一个问题\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l just want to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.70,0:43:33.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.10,0:43:35.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，爸爸！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hey, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.50,0:43:43.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.30,0:43:57.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,约瑟夫，如果你妈妈知道你在踢足球…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Joseph, do you know how mad your mother would be…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.30,0:43:59.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…你知道她会有多生气吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…if she knew you were playing football?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.10,0:44:00.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你会告诉她吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Are you gonna tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.00,0:44:04.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你想打最后一场吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You want to play last of the downs?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.10,0:44:05.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有一个像你这样的大个子\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We got a big guy like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.60,0:44:07.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以加入对方\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You could play on opposite sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.00,0:44:09.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他是波特的堂兄\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He's Potter's cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.80,0:44:12.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他在天普大学担任先发角卫\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He's starting cornerback at Temple University.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.50,0:44:14.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他将在选秀中成为职业选手\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He's going pro in the draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.50,0:44:17.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说他能在4.3秒内跑完40码\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They say he can run the 40 in 4.3 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.10,0:44:19.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.10,0:44:21.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以打败他，爸爸\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You can beat him, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.30,0:44:24.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让我们去打败他们  - 我要进屋了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- Let's beat'em.  - I'm gonna go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.80,0:44:26.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,只要打一轮就可以了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Just play one set of downs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.40,0:44:27.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,我告诉他们你很棒的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l told them you were great.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.60,0:44:29.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为什么这么说？ - 一轮就好\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- Why'd you do that?  - Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.60,0:44:31.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我要进屋了，我还有事情要做\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm gonna go in. I've got some things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.60,0:44:33.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What things?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.10,0:44:34.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去健身了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm gonna work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.70,0:44:36.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来帮你  - 不需要…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- I'll help you.  - l don't need…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.60,0:44:37.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不玩了，伙计们！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l can't play, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.80,0:44:40.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我要帮我爸爸健身！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm working out with my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.30,0:44:45.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,防守！做得很好\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hut! You're doing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.50,0:44:47.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,就是这样！拦住！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Right there! Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.40,0:45:03.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你增加了多少重量？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How much did you put on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.50,0:45:15.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你加的太多了，那是{\u1}250磅{\u0}\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You put too much. That's {\u1}250 pounds{\u0}.
