Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.30,0:45:18.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你能举起多重？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How much can you lift?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.20,0:45:22.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我举过最重的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's the most l ever lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.80,0:45:27.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这很危险的，约瑟夫\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That could've been dangerous, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.60,0:45:28.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在上楼去吧…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Why don't you go upstairs now…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.70,0:45:30.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…让我自己完成训练，好吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and let me finish up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.10,0:45:32.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿掉重量，我可以帮你的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'll take it off. I'll help you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.40,0:45:40.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你能打败李小龙吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You think you could have beaten up Bruce Lee?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.10,0:45:42.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.00,0:45:45.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说，如果你会空手道的话\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l mean, if you knew karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.60,0:45:46.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.50,0:45:53.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不允许他踢腿…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What if he wasn't allowed to kick…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.50,0:45:54.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而你又极其愤怒呢？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and you were really mad at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.90,0:45:56.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不能，约瑟夫\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.10,0:46:40.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你拿掉多少重量？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How much did you take off?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.70,0:46:44.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我骗你的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.90,0:46:49.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你增加重量了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You added?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.80,0:46:59.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,总共多重？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How much is it?
