Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.70,0:47:08.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,再加点重量\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Let's put more.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.00,0:47:13.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.60,0:47:18.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,为了安全起见，你稍微…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Why don't you move back a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.80,0:47:20.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…后退一点，好吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…just to be safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.20,0:47:54.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,还加吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}More?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.40,0:48:08.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远都不要像我这样\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You should never do anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.80,0:48:11.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道吗？ - 知道\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- You know that, right?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.10,0:48:14.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果出事了，你会怎么办？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What do you do If something bad happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.70,0:48:16.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,去找妈妈\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Get Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.30,0:48:18.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Right.
