Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.70,0:49:02.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,全部\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.70,0:49:06.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,还能再加点什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What else can we use?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.30,0:49:35.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,多重？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How much is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.20,0:49:46.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,多重，爸爸？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How much is it, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.20,0:49:51.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,{\u1}350磅{\u0}左右\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}About {\u1}350 pounds{\u0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.20,0:49:51.90,标题 - 副（方正粗黑 25）,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fscx360\fscy80\alpha&H80\c&H403026&\bord0\shad0\pos(325.4,251.2)}■
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.20,0:49:51.90,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\pos(326.4,237.334)}350磅 ≈ 158.76公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.70,0:50:00.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,右手的第五掌骨骨折…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Fracture of the fifth Metacarpal of the right hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.80,0:50:02.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…以及第六、第七和…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…as well as multiple fractures…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.60,0:50:04.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…第八肋骨多处骨折\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…of the sixth, seventh, and eighth ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.50,0:50:05.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，最严重的损伤…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The worst of the injury, however…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.80,0:50:07.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…是右腿遭受的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…was sustained to the right leg…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.20,0:50:09.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…螺旋性骨折\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…in the form of a spiral fracture.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.20,0:50:11.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,共有14处骨折\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}There were 1 4 breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.10,0:50:12.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是非常严重的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It simply shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.30,0:50:16.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他们叫我玻璃娃娃\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They call me Mr Glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.90,0:50:18.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说的？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Who does?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.10,0:50:19.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.70,0:50:22.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗，普莱斯先生？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Are you All right, Mr Price?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.80,0:50:24.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,可以继续吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Shall l continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.20,0:50:28.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,整只腿都已经打上钢钉\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Pins were placed through out the length of the leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.60,0:50:29.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你要以轮椅…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The use of a wheelchair…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.80,0:50:31.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…代步二个月的时间\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…will be needed for a 2 month period.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.50,0:50:35.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,在接下来的12至14个月，使用拐杖\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The use of crutches will follow for 12 to 14 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.00,0:50:37.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,住院治疗时间为5至8天…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hospital stay will range from 5 to 8 days…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.40,0:50:40.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…随后进行9至12个月的物理治疗\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…followed by 9 to 12 months of physical therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.10,0:50:42.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,疼痛管理的处方药物将采用…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Prescribed medication for pain management…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:44.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…{\u1}吗啡{\u0}滴注、{\u1}羟考酮{\u0}、{\u1}达沃赛特{\u0}…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…will take the usual forms of {\u1}morphine{\u0} drip…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.50,0:50:46.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…等常见的形式\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…{\u1}Percocet{\u0}, {\u1}Darvocet{\u0}.
