Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:46.40,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs12\b1\pos(284,162)}羟考酮:
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:46.40,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\pos(325,175)}是一种半合成的蒂巴因衍生物，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:46.40,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\pos(325,187)}强效镇痛药，同时具有抗焦虑、
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:46.40,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\pos(295,199)}镇静作用。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:46.40,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs12\b1\pos(287,212.733)}达沃赛特
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:46.40,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\pos(328,226)}乙酰氨基酚的联用药物，止痛药，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.10,0:50:46.40,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\pos(302,238)}效果弱于吗啡。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.20,0:50:59.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你十点的病人来了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Your 10:00 is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.40,0:51:01.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他在今天早上出院了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The hospital discharged him this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.50,0:51:05.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.20,0:51:15.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,以利亚，对吧？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Elijah, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.10,0:51:18.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将通过这个来防止你的好腿…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We're gonna prevent any substantial atrophy…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.30,0:51:19.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…出现任何实质性萎缩…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…of your good leg with this…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.80,0:51:22.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…它可以锻炼你的股四头肌\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and it works your quadriceps.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.10,0:51:25.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你结婚多久了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How long have you been married?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.10,0:51:31.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 12年了  - 你们为何会结婚？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- 12 years.  - How'd you get together?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.30,0:51:35.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里有点紧张\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm a little nervous being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.20,0:51:38.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我紧张的时候，就喜欢提问题\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l ask too many questions when I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.00,0:51:42.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一场车祸\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}A car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.10,0:51:46.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉我更多细节了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Now you're going to have to tell me more.0
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.20,0:51:53.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我丈夫是大学里的明星运动员…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}My husband was a star athlete in college,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.80,0:51:56.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我们一起遭遇了一场车祸\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and we were in an accident together.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.40,0:51:59.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在结冰的路面翻车了…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Our car flipped on an icy road…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.00,0:51:59.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我们都受了伤…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and we were both injured…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.60,0:52:01.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而他再也无法踢足球了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and he couldn't play football any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.60,0:52:02.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果没有发生这种事…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And if that hadn't happened…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.70,0:52:04.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我们可能也不会在一起了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…we probably wouldn't have been together.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.30,0:52:05.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.20,0:52:08.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们应该谈谈你的康复治疗\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l think we should talk about your rehab.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.20,0:52:10.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不想回答，就不必回答\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You don't have to answer if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.60,0:52:15.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，跟我说说那台机器吧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}So, tell me more about the quad machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.60,0:52:19.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,它可以预防肌肉萎缩…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}lt prevents atrophy by…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.20,0:52:23.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能和一个踢足球的人，共度一生\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l couldn't spend my life with someone who played football.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.50,0:52:25.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It's pretty much that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.60,0:52:28.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我并不讨厌球赛\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And l don't hate the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.20,0:52:30.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我很欣赏它所表现出来的技巧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l admire the amount of skill it involves.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.10,0:52:31.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,和其他人一样…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And like everyone else…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.30,0:52:32.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我对他的踢球方式感到赞叹…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…l was in awe of the way he played it…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.90,0:52:37.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…但足球在很多方面，都与我的职业背道而驰\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…but football, in many ways, is the opposite of what l do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.30,0:52:40.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,通过惩罚对手，来获得更多的奖励\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You're rewarded the more you punish your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.80,0:52:42.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道，这太暴力了…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You know, it's too much about violence…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.40,0:52:44.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而我的生活中不希望有暴力\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and l don't want violence in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.70,0:52:48.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人都不能理解这一点，但是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It's not a thing many people can understand, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.30,0:52:50.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.00,0:52:52.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…那场车祸，都是命运的安排…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…fate stepped in with that car accident…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.70,0:52:54.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…将足球排除在了所有选择之外\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and took football out other equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.90,0:52:57.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,从此以后，每个人都过着幸福的生活\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And everyone lived happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.70,0:53:01.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.40,0:53:04.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫身体的哪个部位受伤了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What part of David's body was in jured?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.20,0:53:08.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过我丈夫名叫大卫吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Who said my husband's name was David?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.20,0:53:16.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,我们就坐吧，好吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Let's just go to our seats, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.80,0:53:18.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,女士们、先生们…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.20,0:53:33.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,在上半场…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}In the first haIf...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.00,0:53:56.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.40,0:54:03.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一架737客机，在起飞时坠毁…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}A 737 crashes on take off…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.90,0:54:07.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…死亡172人，无人生还\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…172 die, no survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.10,0:54:10.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,市中心一家酒店失火，死亡211人…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}A hotel fire downtown, 211 die…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.40,0:54:12.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…无人生还\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…no survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.00,0:54:15.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一列东铁列车，在城外7.5英里处脱轨…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}An East rail train derails, 7.5 miles outside the city…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.80,0:54:19.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…死亡131人，1人生还\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…131 die, one survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.10,0:54:21.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他毫发无损\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He is unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.40,0:54:25.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经和你丈夫谈过，他的幸存问题\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I've spoken with your husband about his survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.50,0:54:28.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉他一个难以置信可能性\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l suggested a rather unbelievable possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.30,0:54:29.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,从那时起…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Since then…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.70,0:54:33.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我开始相信这种可能性…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…I've come to believe that possibility…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.70,0:54:36.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…即使再难以置信，可能性都在增大\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…however unbelievable, is now more aprobability.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.20,0:54:38.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉他什么了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And what was it you suggested?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.30,0:54:42.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是个平凡的时代，邓恩夫人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}These are mediocre times, Mrs Dunn.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.00,0:54:44.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,人们开始失去希望\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}People a restarting to lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.20,0:54:45.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,许多人很难相信…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It's hard for many to believe…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.60,0:54:47.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…他们自己和他人的内心中…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…there are extraordinary things inside themselves…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.90,0:54:49.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…都有非凡的东西\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…as Well as others.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.00,0:54:52.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望，你能敞开你的心扉\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l hope you can keep an open mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.00,0:55:32.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,好的，给你\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}OK, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.20,0:55:33.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.70,0:55:36.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,先生，打扰一下？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Excuse me, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.50,0:55:39.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,可以请你出来一下吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Can you step out of line, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.10,0:55:45.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们遇到了一些问题…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We've been having some problems…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.30,0:55:48.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…有人在体育场里贩卖毒品\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…with people selling drugs here in the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.03,0:55:50.43,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,介意我检查一下你的口袋吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Would you mind if l check your pockets?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.50,0:55:53.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,请把手举起来\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Raise your arms, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.50,0:55:56.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,快点，把手举起来\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Come on, raise them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.00,0:55:58.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚到这里，老兄\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l just got here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.60,0:56:11.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在可以把手放下了吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Can l put my hands down now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.20,0:56:18.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我能走了吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Can l go?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.40,0:56:21.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.00,0:56:25.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你找到什么\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hope you find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.80,0:56:36.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，邓恩\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yo, Dunn.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.10,0:56:39.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,请说\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.20,0:56:40.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚到办公室\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l just came into the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.70,0:56:42.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你的孩子受伤了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Your kid Was hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.90,0:56:45.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪里？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.40,0:56:47.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,学校传来的消息\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Some play rehearsal at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.00,0:56:48.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他要你立刻过去\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He wants you to come down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.80,0:57:05.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你爸爸？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Is that your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.60,0:57:12.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我打赌，我爸爸会教训你爸爸的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l bet my dad could beat up your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.10,0:57:19.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不，他，嗯…他坚持我们只联系你…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No. He, uh…he insisted we call only you…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.50,0:57:21.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…尽管我们很难找到你\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…though we had some trouble tracking you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.60,0:57:24.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是，你不在联络名单上\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l mean, you're not on our list.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.80,0:57:26.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,奥黛丽处理这类事情\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Audrey handles this type of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.50,0:57:28.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，什么类型的事情？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Oh. What type of stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.70,0:57:32.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,约瑟夫的事情\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Joseph stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.90,0:57:38.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要给他，涂点有难闻气味的药膏吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Do l need to put any smelly ointment on him or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.50,0:57:40.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不，不用，这更多是情感上的伤害…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No, no. it's more emotional damage…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.50,0:57:43.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…身体上的伤害，不是很严重\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…not, not too serious, physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.10,0:57:47.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也不像我送你去医院的时候\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Nothing like when l sent you to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.60,0:57:53.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候的事？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}When was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.90,0:57:57.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,当时，我的办公室在大楼的另一边\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}My office was on the other side of the building back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.00,0:58:03.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你不记得我了，对吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You don't remember me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.70,0:58:07.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不记得了，女士\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.30,0:58:09.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前一头红发\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l had red hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.00,0:58:16.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，事情发生的时候，你比约瑟夫还要小一些\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Well, you Were a little younger than Joseph When it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.90,0:58:18.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗，因为你，我们…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Did you know that we changed…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.90,0:58:23.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…改变了，游泳池周围的活动规则？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…the rules of conduct around the pool because of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.80,0:58:27.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们现在还在议论…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The kids still tell about it…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.80,0:58:30.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…像讲鬼故事一样讲这个故事\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…like it was some sort of ghost story.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.40,0:58:35.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道有个小孩，差点淹死在游泳池里吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Did you know there Was a kid nearly drowned in that pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.00,0:58:40.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他沉在池底有五分钟…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He lay on the bottom of the pool for 5 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.30,0:58:42.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…当他们把他救出来的时候…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and When they pulled him out…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.00,0:58:44.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…他已经死了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.30,0:58:51.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们让他们谈论这些\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We let them tell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.30,0:58:53.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这有助于保护他们的安全\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}lt help skeep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.90,0:58:59.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你还怕水吗?\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You still phobic of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.30,0:59:04.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是波特和另一个家伙\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It Was Potter and another guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.70,0:59:09.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在更衣室，捉弄一个中国女生\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They were messing With this Chinese girl in the dressing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.80,0:59:13.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能让坏事发生在好人身上，对吧？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You can't let Bad things happen to good people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.20,0:59:17.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你的准则，对吧？英雄的准则\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's your code, right? That's the hero's code.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.30,0:59:21.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我试着让他们住手…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l tried to make them stop…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.40,0:59:22.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…但他们不断把我推倒…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…but they kept pushing me down…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.60,0:59:24.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…不让我站起来\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and they wouldn't let me get back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.20,0:59:30.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想，也许因为你是我爸爸…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l thought maybe because you're my dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.20,0:59:34.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我想我可能和你一样\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…l thought l might be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.00,0:59:39.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不像你\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.90,0:59:43.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我一样\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You are like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.30,0:59:47.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都可能受伤\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We can both get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.90,0:59:50.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是一个普通人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l'm just an ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.50,0:59:52.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不，你不是\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.20,0:59:55.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么一直那么说？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Why do you keep saying that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.70,1:00:07.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,伊利亚·普莱斯今天到康复中心找我\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Elijah Price came to visit me at the centre today.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.00,1:00:09.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.00,1:00:13.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么也没做，他只是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He didn't do anything. He just…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.00,1:00:15.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…告诉我他的理论\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…told me his theory.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.10,1:00:19.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,病人变成这样，让人感到可悲\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's sad, when patients get like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.70,1:00:21.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不愿面对现实\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They lose reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.80,1:00:29.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,约瑟夫，你到底在干什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Joseph, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.40,1:00:30.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，天啊\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.50,1:00:34.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你不相信，我给你看，你不会受伤的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You don't believe. I'll show you. You can't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.30,1:00:36.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那把枪没有上膛\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That gun's not loaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.80,1:00:38.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,他不知道我把子弹放在哪里\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He doesn't know where l keep the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.30,1:00:40.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,在你年度最佳新人的奖杯里\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}ln your rookie of the year trophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.40,1:00:43.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,约瑟夫，你给枪上膛了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Joseph, did you load that gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.30,1:00:45.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会受伤的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You won't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.90,1:00:47.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,以利亚错了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Elijah Was Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.20,1:00:49.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么时候见过以利亚？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}When did he meet Elijah?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.30,1:00:50.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他和我一起去见的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He was with me when l met him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.70,1:00:52.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没人会相信他\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No one believes him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.90,1:00:54.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,约瑟夫，听我说\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Joseph, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.80,1:00:58.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候，当人们长时间生病…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Sometimes when people get sick…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.00,1:00:59.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…或者受伤的时候…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…or hurt for a long time…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.80,1:01:01.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…就像以利亚一样…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…like Elijah…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.10,1:01:03.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…他们的心理，也会受到伤害…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…their mind gets hurt, too…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.40,1:01:05.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…他们开始思考一些不真实的事情\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and they start to think things, that aren't true.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.00,1:01:07.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他告诉我，他对你父亲的看法\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He told me what he thought about your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.20,1:01:09.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是真的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.00,1:01:10.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让你看看\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.60,1:01:14.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得关于那个差点…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Do you remember the story about…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.80,1:01:17.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…淹死在水池里的男孩的故事吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…about the boy that almost drowned in the pool?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.70,1:01:19.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说的就是我\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That was me they were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.50,1:01:20.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我差点死了，那就是我\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l almost died. That was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.30,1:01:21.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说谎  - 我没有撒谎，好吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- You're lying.  - I'm not lying, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.80,1:01:23.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是不记得了，仅此而已\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l just didn't remember it, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.50,1:01:25.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,约瑟夫，你知道你父亲在大学里受过伤\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Joseph, you know your father was injured in college.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.60,1:01:28.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道的，你知道这一切\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You know that. You know all about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.50,1:01:31.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,别开枪，他会死的，约瑟夫\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Don't do it. He'll die, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.20,1:01:33.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,- 他会死的，约瑟夫  - 我只射他一枪\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- He'll die, Joseph.  - I'll just shoot him once.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.30,1:01:35.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,约瑟夫，听你妈说的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Joseph, listen to what your mot…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.70,1:01:38.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不要害怕\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Don't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.00,1:01:41.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,约瑟夫…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Joseph…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.00,1:01:44.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…你要是扣动板机，我就搬走\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…if you pull that trigger, I'm going to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.70,1:01:47.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白吗？我要搬去纽约\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Do you understand? l'm going to go to New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.39,1:01:49.99,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.20,1:01:51.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你扣动扳机…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}If you pull that trigger…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.60,1:01:53.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…子弹还是会从我身上弹开…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…that bullet is just going to bounce off me…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.40,1:01:55.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而我不会受伤…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and I'm not going to be hurt…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.00,1:01:56.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…但我接着会上楼去…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…but then I'm going to go upstairs…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.60,1:01:58.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…收拾行李，动身前往…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and I'm going to pack and I'm going to leave…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.80,1:02:00.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…纽约\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}for New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.00,1:02:03.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 因为我以为我们开始…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- Why?  - Because l thought we were just starting…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.00,1:02:04.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…成为真正的朋友…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…to be friends for real…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.70,1:02:07.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而朋友之间，会互相倾听\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and friends will listen to each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.00,1:02:11.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会互相开枪，对吧，奥黛丽？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And they don't shoot each other, do they, Audrey?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.70,1:02:14.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不能向朋友开枪，约瑟夫\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No shooting friends, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.90,1:02:16.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,约瑟夫…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Joseph…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.40,1:02:20.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…你遇到大麻烦了！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…you are about to be in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.60,1:02:23.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,现在，我是你的父亲，我告诉你…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Now, l am your father, and l am telling you…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.60,1:02:26.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…马上把那该死的枪放下！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…to put that goddamn gun down right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.10,1:02:28.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}1 …
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.30,1:02:30.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,二…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}2…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.80,1:02:51.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟着那个穿着迷彩外套的家伙\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l followed the guy in the camouflage jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.30,1:02:56.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他裤子后面塞着一把黑色…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He had a silver gun with a black grip…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.20,1:02:58.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…握把的银色手枪\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…tucked in the back of his pants.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.40,1:03:03.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的在大学的那场车祸中受伤了吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Were you really injured in that car accident in college?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.70,1:03:05.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我觉得你是假装的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Because l believe you faked it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.80,1:03:07.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你抓住这个机会…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l believe you took the opportunity…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.30,1:03:10.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…结束你的足球生涯，毋庸置疑\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…to end your football career, no questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.20,1:03:13.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你这么做，是为了一个女人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And l think you did it, of all things, for a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.00,1:03:16.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为那很合理\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.10,1:03:19.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,足球之类的，也就十年…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Football's, what, Just 1 0 years…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.50,1:03:20.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…但爱…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…but love…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.10,1:03:24.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…嗯，则是永恒\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hmm. Now, that's forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.30,1:03:29.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,而你提到的，早晨的那一点点悲伤？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And that little bit of sadness in the mornings you spoke of?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.60,1:03:31.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我知道那是什么\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l think l know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.90,1:03:35.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,也许是因为，你没有做你应该做的事情\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Perhaps you're not doing what you're supposed to be doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.70,1:03:37.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,大多数枪，都有黑色或银色的枪柄\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Most guns have a black or silver handle.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.60,1:03:39.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我有50%的机会，把颜色说对了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l had a 50 50 shot of getting the colour right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.70,1:03:42.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那不是我亲眼目睹  - 够了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- That's not What l Witnessed.  - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.90,1:03:45.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,别再来扰乱我的生活，以利亚\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Stop messing with my life, Elijah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.50,1:03:48.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子昨晚差点向我开枪…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}My son almost shot me last night…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.70,1:03:50.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…因为他想证明你是对的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…because he wanted to prove you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.20,1:03:52.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我从未说过，你有不死之身\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l never said you couldn't be killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.10,1:03:54.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我从未说过  - 我的妻子是对的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- l never said that.  - My wife was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.00,1:03:56.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,已经发生的三次重大灾难…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}There have been 3 major disasters…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.80,1:03:59.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而你是唯一一个毫发无伤的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and you Were the only one unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.20,1:04:00.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我生过病\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l have been sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.40,1:04:05.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,在我小的时候，我为了治好肺炎…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}When l was a kid, l spent a week in the hospital…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.30,1:04:07.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…而在医院住了一个星期\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…getting better from pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.00,1:04:09.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我差点溺死\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l almost drowned.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.90,1:04:13.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,两个小孩恶作剧，把我扔进水池里…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}2 skinny little kids were fooling around in a pool dunking me…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.90,1:04:15.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我喝了很多水\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and l swallowed some water.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.50,1:04:17.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不知道，我差点因此丧命\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They didn't know it, and it almost killed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.70,1:04:20.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄不会死的如此凄惨\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Heroes don't get killed like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.40,1:04:23.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,普通人会，对吧？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Normal people do, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.20,1:04:27.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再见到你了，好吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l don't need to see you any more, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.80,1:04:31.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,请离我的家人远一点\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Please stay away from my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.20,1:04:48.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿，伙计，20点了，该做出选择了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hey, man, it's 20 after. it's time to choose.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.40,1:04:49.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l gotta head.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.90,1:04:57.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好别学日本漫画那样做…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You better not be Jacking off to the Japanese comics…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.30,1:04:58.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我向上帝发誓\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…l swear to God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.10,1:05:14.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，伙计，我不知道你是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Look, man, l didn't know you were in a…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.70,1:05:18.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,随便选点什么，好吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Just choose something, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.60,1:05:26.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,保姆到了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The baby sitter's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.60,1:05:30.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,要取消吗?\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Should we cancel?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.10,1:05:32.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.70,1:05:37.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以改天再去\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We can do this another time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.60,1:05:40.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,别说谎了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.60,1:05:45.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好，我只是有点困惑\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm fine. l just got mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.70,1:05:55.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去喝点东西怎么样？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How about we just go for a couple drinks?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.80,1:06:03.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，听着，伙计，我要推你出去\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Okay, look, man, I'm just going to wheel you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.80,1:06:05.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧？你可以在外边的人行道上，继续思考\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}All right? You can think about things outside on the sidewalk.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.80,1:06:08.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去吃点东西，你知道我在说什么吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l got to get some chicken in me, you know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.70,1:06:27.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.40,1:06:45.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.50,1:06:49.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄  我不管你在轮椅上还是怎么样\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Man, l don't care if you are in a wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.90,1:06:52.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,再这样我就叫警察了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}If you do that again, I'm calling 50.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.30,1:06:56.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.60,1:07:09.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,够了，怪人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's it, crackerjack.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.00,1:07:11.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在就等着去坐牢吧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You're going to be sitting your ass in jail now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.60,1:07:35.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这本多少钱？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}How much for this one?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.50,1:07:39.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,铁锈色？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Rust?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.00,1:07:41.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.10,1:07:44.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,作为颜色，不能叫铁锈色\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}As a colour, not as rust.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.50,1:07:45.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 ，就像…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You know, like…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.10,1:07:48.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…铁锈色的油漆或木头\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…rust coloured paint or wood.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.10,1:07:51.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不懂这些\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.50,1:07:55.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是最爱棕色\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Mine's still brown.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.30,1:07:58.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，轮到我了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Okay, my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.20,1:07:59.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢的歌曲?\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Favourite song?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.60,1:08:04.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,原名王子的艺术家唱的《柔软而潮湿》\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Soft and Wet by artist formerly known as prince 
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.80,1:08:06.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.30,1:08:09.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该坦诚相待\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We're supposed to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.10,1:08:12.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,《柔软而潮湿》\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Soft and Wet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.70,1:08:14.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.00,1:08:16.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，轮到我了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Okay, my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.80,1:08:20.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你第一次想到…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}When was the first time…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.30,1:08:25.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我们可能无法厮守终身，是什么时候？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…the thought popped into your head we might not make it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.80,1:08:28.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这不属于游戏\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's not the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.00,1:08:31.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一次约会，没有任何规则\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It's the first date. There aren't any rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.30,1:08:37.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.90,1:08:39.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,仔细想想\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Think carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.10,1:08:42.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏怎么办？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What about the game?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.90,1:08:44.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了，我赢了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}it's over. l won.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.10,1:08:49.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，也许不是什么特定时间\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Look, maybe it wasn't a specific moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.00,1:08:50.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,也许只是某时…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Maybe it was a time…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.60,1:08:53.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,有天晚上，我做了一场噩梦…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l had a nightmare one night…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.20,1:08:55.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…而我…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.00,1:08:59.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…没有叫醒你，因为你只会说一切都好\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…l didn't wake you up, so you could tell me that it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.20,1:09:03.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想，那就是第一次出现\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l think that was the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.70,1:09:07.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这算吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Does that count?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.30,1:09:10.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That counts.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.10,1:09:19.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你是故意疏离我和约瑟夫的？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Do you knowingly keep me and Joseph at a distance?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.60,1:09:28.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.10,1:09:30.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.40,1:09:34.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.80,1:09:42.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是觉得不对劲，奥黛丽\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l just don't feel right, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.80,1:09:45.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,有些事情…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Something's…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.20,1:09:48.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…不太对劲\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…just not right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.50,1:09:52.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你怨恨我们吗，大卫？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Do you resent us, David?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.80,1:09:56.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌你的生活吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Resent the life you have?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.20,1:09:59.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,我的意思是，大学毕业后…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l mean, there were a lot of …
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.20,1:10:01.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…你本可以去做，很多其他的事情\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…other things you could've done after college.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.90,1:10:04.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这些都是你的选择\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}These were your choices.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.10,1:10:11.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道，即使这意味着我们不能长相厮守…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You know, even if it meant we couldn't have been together…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.40,1:10:13.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我也不会希望你受到伤害\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…l never would've wished that injury on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.90,1:10:18.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你的身体是上天的恩赐\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What you could do physically was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.80,1:10:22.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来都不希望你失去它\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l never would've wished it to go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.80,1:10:26.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道的，对吧？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.00,1:10:33.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,约瑟夫上床后，有两个电话找你…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You had 2 calls after Joseph went to bed…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.30,1:10:35.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,第一个是我正在通话时，打进来的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}One came through while l was on the other line…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.10,1:10:36.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…但我没说太久\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…but I wasn't talking long.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.30,1:10:37.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我姐姐那儿有突发情况\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}There was an emergency with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.70,1:10:40.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,她准备烫头发，感觉她…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}She tried to do a perm, and she looks…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.00,1:10:42.15,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,谁打来的？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Who called through?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.40,1:10:44.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，一个人从纽约打来…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Uh, someone from New York…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.90,1:10:47.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…嗯，关于安保工作\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…uh, about a security job. 
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.00,1:10:48.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,他们想雇用你\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They Want to hire you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.80,1:10:50.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道，你们一家要搬去纽约\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l didn't know you guys were moving to New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.40,1:10:52.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,谢谢你告诉我\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Thanks for telling me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.80,1:10:54.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是全家都去\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We weren't all going to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.60,1:11:03.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,另一个电话是答录机接的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l let the answering machine pick up the other call.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.10,1:11:09.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.60,1:11:25.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,听着，老实说吧，我们才刚刚开始…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Look, let's just be honest here. We're just at the beginning…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.50,1:11:28.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我并不希望你或我因为…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and l don't expect you or l to change…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.50,1:11:31.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…一次约会就去改变我们…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…the course of where our lives were headed…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.00,1:11:32.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…原本的生活方向\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…because of one date.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.50,1:11:36.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你去纽约，我们还可以…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And if you do go to New York, we can…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.80,1:11:38.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…继续发展\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…develop this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.00,1:11:40.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,当然，我们只能慢慢来\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We'll just be forced to take it slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.20,1:11:43.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,最后，我觉得这样肯定…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}And in the end, l think that's definitely…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.10,1:11:45.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…更好\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…better.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.50,1:11:49.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说，这是我们第二次复合了，大卫\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l mean, this is our second time around, David.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.20,1:11:52.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不期待我们会忘乎所以，你知道的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l didn't expect us to get carried away, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.40,1:11:57.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我该做的是，对你说声“恭喜”\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Then l guess ''congratulations'' is the right thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.10,1:12:25.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫，我是以利亚\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}David, it's Elijah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.60,1:12:27.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,事情很明显\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It was so obvious.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.20,1:12:30.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,有一期漫画，让一切浮现在我面前\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It was this one issue that brought it back forme.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.00,1:12:32.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,世纪漫画117期\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Century Comics 117.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.10,1:12:34.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个组织，叫做邪恶联盟…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's where this group, the Coalition of Evil…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.10,1:12:36.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…试图查探，每一个超级英雄的弱点…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…tried to ascertain the Weakness of every superhero…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.60,1:12:38.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…因为他们跟你一样…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…because they all have one…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.70,1:12:40.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…都有弱点\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.30,1:12:41.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你的骨头不会断\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Your bones don't break.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.80,1:12:43.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,我的会\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Mine do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.10,1:12:44.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,这很明显\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's clear. 
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.50,1:12:46.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你的细胞，对细菌和病毒的反应…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Your cells react to bacteria and viruses…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.60,1:12:48.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…与我的不同\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…differently than mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.00,1:12:50.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会生病，我会\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You don't get sick. I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.30,1:12:52.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,这也很明显\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's also clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.10,1:12:53.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,但基于某种原因…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}But for some reason…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.60,1:12:57.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…你和我对水的反应，完全一样\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…you and l react the exact same way to water.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.40,1:13:00.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,吞咽的太快，我们都会呛到\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We swallow it too fast, we choke.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.00,1:13:02.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,吸进肺里，我们就会溺死\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We get some in our lungs, we drown.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.10,1:13:04.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,无论看起来多么不真实…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}However unreal it may seem…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.70,1:13:07.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我们都是相连的，你和我\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…we are connected, you and l.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.50,1:13:09.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在同一条曲线上…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We're on the same curve…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.60,1:13:11.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…只是身处相反的两端\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…just on opposite ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.20,1:13:13.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切的重点是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The point of all this is…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.40,1:13:15.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…我们现在了解到，以前的未知\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…we now know something we didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.40,1:13:18.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你的弱点是…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You have a weakness…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.50,1:13:19.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…水\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…water.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.00,1:13:22.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,它就像你的{\u1}氪石{\u0}\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It's like your {\u1}kryptonite{\u0}.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.00,1:13:22.20,标题 - 副（方正粗黑 25）,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fscx590\fscy310\alpha&H80\c&H403026&\bord0\shad0\pos(319,268.867)}■
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.00,1:13:22.20,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs12\b1\pos(319,181)}氪石：{\fs10\b1}漫画《超人》系列中的一种
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.00,1:13:22.20,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\pos(331,193)}假想矿物，被设定为超人众
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.00,1:13:22.20,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(321,205)}所周知的弱点之一。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.00,1:13:22.20,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(334,217)}现实世界中，“Kryptonite”
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.00,1:13:22.20,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(331,229)}一词也已经成为一名刀枪不
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.00,1:13:22.20,注释 - 通用（方正兰亭黑_GBK 16）,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(331,241)}不入英雄的弱点的代名词。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.00,1:13:24.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗，大卫？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You hearing me, David?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.20,1:15:41.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,奥黛丽\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Audrey?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.50,1:16:16.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,抓住了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.40,1:16:18.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.40,1:16:36.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,奥黛丽？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Audrey?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.40,1:16:38.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,奥黛丽？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Audrey?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.40,1:16:45.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.49,1:16:51.69,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,奥黛丽\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Audrey?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.30,1:16:54.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.60,1:16:56.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.30,1:16:58.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,我以为我…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l thought l was…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.70,1:17:00.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为我死了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l thought l was dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.30,1:17:02.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.90,1:17:09.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,她没事吧？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}ls she all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.90,1:17:11.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想她的腿断了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l think her leg's broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.40,1:17:14.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你有受伤吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.90,1:17:16.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，伙计，你有受伤吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hey, man, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.60,1:17:48.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.70,1:17:52.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我在那场车祸中没有受伤\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l Wasn't injured in that car accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.50,1:17:53.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}David.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.30,1:17:57.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我从未受过伤，以利亚\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I've never been injured, Elijah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.20,1:18:02.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么做？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What am l supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.40,1:18:10.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,去人群中走走\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Go to where people are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.20,1:18:13.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用寻找太长的时间\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You won't have to look very long.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.00,1:18:18.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,害怕是正常的，大卫…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}lt's all right to be afraid, David…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.00,1:18:21.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…因为这部分，与漫画书不同\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…because this part Won't be like a comic book.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.10,1:18:27.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,现实世界，是无法装进漫画的格子的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Real life doesn't fit into little boxes that were drawn for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.70,1:19:09.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,第一排中的一个，那边的第二个\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}There's one in the first row. it's the second one.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.30,1:19:12.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,对，数过去的第二个\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yes. it's the second one over.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.40,1:19:48.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,滚回非洲去吧！\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Go back to Africa!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.90,1:20:06.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，你叫什么名字？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Hey, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.80,1:20:14.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你喝多了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l think you drank too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.60,1:21:02.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以进来吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Can l come in?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.70,1:21:04.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.30,1:21:07.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的房子\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l like your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.20,1:21:09.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以进来吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Can l come in?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.20,1:21:11.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.20,1:21:16.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不，你不能进来\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No. You can't come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.60,1:21:19.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.70,1:21:21.82,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,什么…你干什么…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What...what are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.20,1:25:53.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.80,1:26:04.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了，没事了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}it's okay. it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.80,1:32:52.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了个恶梦\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l had a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.20,1:33:00.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没事了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}it's over now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.20,1:33:30.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是我啊  - 我不知道\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- It's me.  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.20,1:33:34.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我不敢相信，你会这么想\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l can't believe you'd think that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.40,1:33:36.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是问问你\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm just asking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.50,1:33:41.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我要做法国土司\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm making French toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.30,1:33:59.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在想伊利亚·普莱斯\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I've been thinking about Elijah Price.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.20,1:34:04.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他再出现，我想我们应该报警，好吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}If he shows up again, l think we should call the police, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.10,1:34:10.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗?\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.70,1:34:14.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 \N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.60,1:35:25.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.30,1:36:18.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这是约翰·戴维斯早期的绘画作品之一\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}This is one of Johann Davis' earliest drawings.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.50,1:36:21.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,看到坏人的眼睛了吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}See the villain's eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.00,1:36:24.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,它们比其他角色的都要大\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They're larger than the other characters'.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.30,1:36:27.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这也暗示了，他们对世界的…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They insinuate a slightly skewed perspective…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.90,1:36:30.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…看法有点扭曲…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…on how they see the world…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.90,1:36:32.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,有点不正常\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Just off normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.30,1:36:35.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,他看起来并不可怕\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He doesn't look scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.90,1:36:38.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我对我儿子也这么说…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's what l said to my son…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.30,1:36:40.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…但他说坏人一般分两种\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…but he says there's always 2 kinds.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.10,1:36:43.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一种是反派士兵…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}There's the soldier villain…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.10,1:36:45.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…用双手与英雄搏斗…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…who fights the hero with his hands…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.50,1:36:47.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…然后是真正的威胁…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and then there's the real threat the…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.60,1:36:50.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…聪明又邪恶的魔王…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…brilliant and evil archenemy…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.00,1:36:52.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…用他的头脑与英雄战斗\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…who fights the hero with his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.70,1:36:55.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是以利亚的母亲  - 是的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- Are you Elijah's mother?  - I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.10,1:36:58.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我在帮他进行销售\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm helping him with the sale.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.50,1:37:01.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你，我是大卫·邓恩\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Nice to meet you. I'm David Dunn.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.40,1:37:03.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他提过你\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He's spoken of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.40,1:37:05.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他说你们成为了朋友\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Says you're becoming friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.50,1:37:06.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}We are.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.00,1:37:10.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来，他今天情况不错\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Looks like he's doing good today.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.40,1:37:13.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我为他感到骄傲\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm very proud of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.20,1:37:16.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他一生中经历了很多…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He's come through a lot in his life…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.60,1:37:20.80,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…几次糟糕的经历，几乎让他崩溃\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…a couple of bad spells l thought had broken him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.50,1:37:24.30,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那种糟糕…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}They were bad…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.40,1:37:27.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…但他挺过来了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…but he made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.00,1:37:29.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没错，他做到了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yes, he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.10,1:37:33.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他真是个奇迹\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He's kind of a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.50,1:37:37.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.00,1:37:43.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去告诉他，你来了  - 谢谢\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- I'll tell him you're here.  - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.90,1:38:15.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,一切已经开始了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It has begun.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.10,1:38:20.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我吧，大卫\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Tell me something, David.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.30,1:38:24.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天早上醒来的时候…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}When you woke up this morning…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.60,1:38:26.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…还有那种感觉吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…was it still there?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.00,1:38:28.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,悲伤？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}The sadness?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.90,1:38:31.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.50,1:38:38.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我想，现在我们可以握手了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l think this is where we shake hands. 
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.90,1:39:12.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我在那旅馆工作25年了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l worked in that building 25 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.60,1:39:14.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道它所有的秘密\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l know all its secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.00,1:39:17.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,秘密？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Secrets?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.60,1:39:24.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,就像如果一楼、二楼或者三楼发生火灾…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Like if there ever was a fire on floors 1 , 2, or 3…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.60,1:39:28.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,…那家酒店的每个人，都会被活活烧死\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…everyone in that hotel would be burned alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.00,1:39:36.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,旅客是不准进到那里面的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Passengers aren't allowed in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.10,1:40:22.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道，最可怕的事是什么吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Do you know What the scariest thing is?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.30,1:40:28.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道自己在世界上的位置…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}To not know your place in this world…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.60,1:40:32.50,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…不知道自己，所存在的意义\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…to not know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.40,1:40:34.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,那种…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.40,1:40:39.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,,0,0,0,,那种感觉太糟糕了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}That's just an awful feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.10,1:40:42.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.60,1:40:46.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我几乎放弃了希望\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l almost gave up hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.10,1:40:51.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我质疑过自己很多次\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}There were so many times l questioned myseIf.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.00,1:40:52.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀了那些人\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You killed all those people.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.80,1:40:56.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,但我找到了你\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}But l found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.80,1:41:01.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,牺牲了这么多人…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}So many sacrifices…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.30,1:41:06.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,- …只为了找到你  - 上帝啊\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}- …just to find you.  - Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.20,1:41:18.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,既然现在，我们知道你是谁…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Now that we know who you are…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.00,1:41:22.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…我也知道，我是谁了\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…l know who l am.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.60,1:41:28.60,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有错\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}I'm not a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.10,1:41:32.10,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切都很合理\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}It all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.50,1:41:36.70,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,在漫画中，你知道如何判断谁将是大反派吗？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}In a comic, you know how you can tell who the arch villain's going to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.00,1:41:40.40,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,他和英雄完全相反…\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}He's the exact opposite of the hero…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.40,1:41:44.00,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,…大多数时候，他们是朋友，就像你我一样\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}…and most times, they're friends, like you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.30,1:41:45.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,我早该明白这一点的\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}l should've known way back when.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.90,1:41:47.90,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道为什么吗，大卫？\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}You know why, David?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.20,1:41:50.20,字幕 - 中英（兰亭粗黑_GBK 18）,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那些孩子们\N{\fnSegoe UI Black}{\fs12\c&HFFFF00&}Because of the kids.
